CrmArchiveHelp=The e-mail history of a deal is filled by the Dolibarr e-mail collector, which reads this mailbox. In Setup > Modules > E-mail collector, add a collector for the archive mailbox and, as its operation, choose "CRM: record the e-mail on its deal". Only e-mails sent by the module, and answers or replies that quote them, are kept. Any other message in that mailbox is ignored. A customer answer is only seen when the mailbox receives it: it is a Bcc, so the customer's "reply all" does not reach it, and the salesperson must copy or forward the answer to that address.
